ধরি objective = {"parameters": [2, -1], "targets": [1, 3], "weights": [2, 0.5], "lowerBounds": [-5, -5], "upperBounds": [5, 5]}

ধরি value = optimize.quadratic_value(objective)
ধরি gradient = optimize.finite_difference_gradient(objective, 0.001)
ধরি proposal = optimize.projected_gradient_step(objective, {"learningRate": 0.25, "epsilon": 0.001})

দেখাও value
দেখাও gradient["gradient"][0]
দেখাও gradient["gradient"][1]
দেখাও proposal["proposedParameters"][0]
